cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "service-see-through: the see-through decomposer, packaged as a release"
abstract: >
  A service: the packing of a transport layer and two interactors into one
  deployable thing, and the release ladder that says which rung a tag may take.
  It holds no code of its own -- what runs together, why the membership is what
  it is, and the gate on a promotion nobody may automate.
